    "description": "Market stall, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Over budget: 83 blocks vs 17 (and 3 x 3 instead of 3 x 2, so the trader has a spot behind the counter). Spruce-post stall with a plank counter under a thin, sloped awning of red and white carpet stripes on trapdoor boards; trader enters from the side; L1 has barrels, a crate, grain and a trade sign; L2 adds the striped wool front edge, lanterns, produce, grain and a shelf; L3 the sign post, banner, stool, back barrel, scraps bin and flowers. Not yet builder-tested: dandelion, melon, pumpkin, red_wall_banner, red_wool, white_wool. Decoration step adds: item, potted_plant, sign_text.",
